# About

I'm Lautaro Acosta Quintana, a student from Argentina currently pursuing an Information Systems Engineering degree at [UTN](https://www.frre.utn.edu.ar/).

I love solving problems by thinking about systems and looking for the best way to do things. I've found the intersection between software engineering and computer science such a deeply interesting space that I've decided to try to be great at it.

While I do spend a [*lot of time* reading](/reading.html), I try to [write about things I find interesting](/writing.html).

You can find my résumé in [English](https://cdn.lautaroacosta.com/resume_us_3.pdf) or [Spanish](https://cdn.lautaroacosta.com/resume_es_3.pdf).
